## Summary

When the layout worker posts an error, the handler calls send("error", ...) which invokes log_frontend — not the toast system. The user sees nothing: graph silently remains at seed layout.

## Evidence

- **File**: `src/views/Graph.tsx` (lines 168-170)

```
} else if (m.type === "error") {
        send("error", `[graph] layout failed: ${m.message}`);
      }
```

## Suggested fix

Call showToast({ kind: 'err', text: `Graph layout failed: ${m.message}` }).

