## Summary

Before any run completes, get_status returns next_run_in_secs = INTERVAL (21600), but periodic loop actually fires at STARTUP_DELAY (60s) after spawn. Status misreports next consolidation by ~5h58m during first minute after every fresh start.

## Evidence

- **File**: `src-tauri/src/scheduler.rs` (lines 159-178)

```
} else {
    INTERVAL.as_secs()
};
```

## Suggested fix

Track loop's next-due Instant (or subtract STARTUP_DELAY when last_finish is None).

